From: Mahdi Arts <mahdi-arts@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: 2026-08-20
Subject: [PATCH] ci: activate hardened CI & release workflows (supply-chain gates)

Applies the hardened .github/workflows/ci.yml and release.yml
(blocking audits, tests, smoke; SHA256SUMS + per-artifact SBOM + provenance).
Apply with:  git am docs/patches/hardened-ci-workflows.patch
Pushing workflow files needs a token with the 'workflows' scope.

diff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
index 42a9fd4..2ea0af4 100644
